WEBVTT

04:31.875 --> 04:33.417
Tell her to give me their address.

04:33.500 --> 04:36.000
Tell him where they are.
He'll take them home.

04:36.167 --> 04:38.625
-I don't know.
-Come on! He's your brother.

04:38.750 --> 04:39.709
He's not my brother.

04:40.167 --> 04:41.250
I don't have a brother.

04:41.375 --> 04:42.709
I have nothing to do with this man.
